<title>NETHERLANDS: Wereldhave proposes stock div 5.88 pct.</title>
<headline>Wereldhave proposes stock div 5.88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch property fund Wereldhave NV said on Friday it proposed a stock dividend of 5.88 percent or a cash dividend of 7.25 guilders per share over 1996.</p>
<p>The stock dividend equals one new ordinary share per every 17 shares held.</p>
<p>Wereldhave said it considered a stock option as justified in view of the prospects for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
